flowchart LR
    U[Browser user] --> FE[React + TypeScript frontend]
    FE -->|HTTPS authenticated REST| API[FastAPI API]
    API --> AUTH[JWT authentication + server-side RBAC]
    API --> DOC[Document, review and verification APIs]
    API --> AUDIT[Audit and security event service]
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    DOC --> STORE[Protected document storage]
    DOC --> PUB[Public verification endpoint]
    PUB --> PROOF[Minimal authenticity proof\nprivate source remains hidden]
    DB --> USERS[Users and roles]
    DB --> RECORDS[Documents and review records]
    DB --> EVENTS[Audit and security events]
